BiRefNet background removal
Uses the official MIT-licensed BiRefNet general model by Peng Zheng and contributors.
Inference uses ort (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and ONNX Runtime (MIT). On Windows, DirectML
uses the Microsoft DirectML binary licence. Complete model/runtime notices are in
third-party/birefnet; pinned sources and SHA-256 values are documented in
docs/birefnet-background-removal.md. Model/runtime binaries are downloaded on demand.

Papierwerk outward paper border
